Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libegl1, libdbus-1-3, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, libegl-mesa0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/a-kurczyn/spacescan
Description: disk-usage explorer with a sunburst chart and reports
 SpaceScan scans a drive or folder and shows where the space goes, as a
 sunburst chart and as a table you can drive from the keyboard. Files are
 grouped by kind, with filters by name and category. It can delete, move
 to the trash, copy and move files without touching other mounted drives,
 and writes text, CSV and JSON reports from the command line.
